<title>JAPAN: Japan July housing starts rise 21.7% year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan July housing starts rise 21.7% year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's housing starts in July rose 21.7 percent from a year earlier to 157,114 units, the Construction Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>					July starts   yr/yr pct change</p>
<p> Private homes			67,863	    +33.2</p>
<p> Rental homes			 54,595	    +19.1</p>
<p> Employee housing		    2,689	    +12.7</p>
<p> Housing built for sale	   31,967	     +6.6</p>
<p>  Condominiums			19,388	     +7.0</p>
<p> Total				 157,114	    +21.7</p>
</text>
